ver dropped by probability; retained sample carries reason/probability/policy version; denominator and unknown/duplicate/dropped counted separately.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"queue-budget-dedupe\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Queue cap 1024, batch cap 512, retention 300000ms, evict ordinary success first, explicit over-budget/expiry/export-failure counters; dedupe history 4096/300000ms with a retirement watermark.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"fixture-cost\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Local deterministic fixture: association 100% with no budget overflow and zero duplicate billing; identical redacted OTLP set re-derives the same measured cost.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"local-otlp-roundtrip\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Real producer + plugin service exercised through a local neutral HTTP OTLP collector; success/error/refusal/recovery/cancel/duplicate/out-of-order/expiry/budget/export-failure/close-rollback covered.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"clean-candidate-gates\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Clean candidate commit; focused tests + types + lint + harness + comms passed; credential scan 0 hits.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"productLocks\": {\r\n    \"live_ready\": false,\r\n    \"product_approved\": false,\r\n    \"default_on\": false,\r\n    \"changed\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"credentialScan\": {\r\n    \"command\": \"regex scan over the 16 changed files (phc_/sk-/AKIA/PRIVATE KEY/ghp_/xox.)\",\r\n    \"files\": 16,\r\n    \"hits\": 0\r\n  },\r\n  \"notMeasured\": [\r\n    \"Live third-party provider calls (fixture + local OTLP only).\",\r\n    \"Price accuracy against a provider invoice.\",\r\n    \"Non-Windows platforms.\",\r\n    \"Remote CI.\",\r\n    \"A separate second-agent independent verifier role.\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"landing\": {\r\n    \"pushed\": false,\r\n    \"pr\": null,\r\n    \"note\": \"Pushed with the evidence commit in the same session; see the branch's PR.\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n-----SHA-----\r\n7fe10b0488d8c518f632df05389de71f5cce4b52979f468f80439614d2213e53  docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/o02-acceptance.json\r\n66f6f7e9ab9f5ca5e18407872872871ba8daa1832c77ee4531486a6b058eae90  docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/o02-trace-cost-sampling.md\r\n6580985c6f3efae00f1076629e5c30209af63b06ad5d97c60df605a153ae1b78  harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-trace-cost-sampling.md\r\nf2e5b6a6fe2ed9a94275cf05f3943f83e67b6ae00267e78dae00cc558a158823  harness/specs/rules/trace-cost-sampling-boundary.md\r\n747678ee2eb2435d19f82920ec7085b04a94a73d7e0fec18413c49816737d8f8  openclaw_runtime/extensions/diagnostics-otel/src/cost-sampling.ts\r\n7bddc85cbf367d1c5e84ee8842783123c627678ea505e480b9e72225361add42  openclaw_runtime/extensions/diagnostics-otel/src/cost-sampling.test.ts\r\n6cb948e96e67cb57815092f5413a9d007c5e1a7ee602a6cc78a8d7cd96c9cd8d  openclaw_runtime/src/agents/embedded-agent-runner/run/attempt.model-call-usage.ts\r\n97acd0c69e2c5ccb081bf45e4e98988420e94c02c4219ed635992725b9e07bc3  tests/unit/harness-gap-trace-cost-sampling.test.ts\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'cat docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/o02-trace-cost-sampling.md'","aggregated_output":"# O02：请求成本与脱敏轨迹\r\n\r\n本包沿已有model.call事件与diagnostics-otel插件接线；ObservabilityTraceRecorder不被改造成第二usage服务。完整实施/验收以o02-acceptance.json为准，未产生前不声称完成。\r\n\r\n## 显式试用\r\n\r\n在已有diagnostics.flags中选择trace.cost-sampling，且保持原diagnostics.otel.enabled=true。成功样本概率复用diagnostics.otel.sampleRate；省略概率为1。移除flag或关闭原OTel即回滚，不改账单/审批/产品锁。外部预加载SDK不能保证接管终态采样时报告不支持，而不是静默通过。\r\n\r\n## 口径\r\n\r\nrun/session/request/attempt使用域分离SHA256；工具通过原toolCallId摘要关联，effect使用既有OTel span/parent身份而非捏造EffectReceipt。仅最终结构化usage参与单次调用估价；目录费率是USD/百万token，随内容摘要版本记录。全零目录常为未知占位，不能冒充免费；未知成本null（OTLP用状态和缺席数值）。\r\n\r\n总体计数先于采样，保留样本重算仅代表样本，不是总体账单。固定seed=openclaw.trace.cost-sampling.v1；错误/拒绝/恢复不受概率丢弃。队列1024/批512/TTL五分钟，dedupe4096/五分钟；预算/过期/导出丢失单列。不会声称有限预算支持无限关键样本。无正文或原始身份持久化，无新增store或默认启用。\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
